, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Foutput_1.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Foutput_1.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Foutput_1.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Foutput_1.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Foutput_1.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Foutput_1.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Foutput_1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Foutput_1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Greetings and respect</p>\n<h4>We have designed a very attractive and innovative plan for a smart city that includes over 50 new plans and inventions designed mechanically and has new communication systems, transportation systems, new hardware and software.</h4>\n<h4>The goal of this plan is to improve the quality of life for citizens and optimize energy and resource consumption. By using advanced technologies and countless innovations, the smart city we have designed offers significant improvements in areas such as security, transportation, waste management, energy and water management, traffic monitoring, and more.</h4>\n<h4>We are proud to announce that the smart city we have designed can be several times smarter than the smart city \"alnama\" in Saudi Arabia.</h4>\n<h4>Our team consists of experienced and specialized individuals in the field of smart city development. We are proud to offer this plan that enables us to create a smart city that optimizes urban infrastructure and makes optimal use of urban resources.</h4>\n<h4>Given that this plan has very attractive investment capabilities, we are looking for investors who are interested in this project and can help create a dynamic and innovative smart city.</h4>\n<p> </p>\nsrc=\"/media/smart-city.png\"smart city\n<h2>Our claim:<br />\n</h2>\n<h4>Is that based on the plans and inventions we have, we can improve and optimize smart cities several times over. By using modern technologies and countless innovations, we can achieve significant improvements in areas such as security, transportation, waste management, energy and water management, traffic monitoring, and more. Additionally, these inventions can be utilized in the construction of smart cities, and by optimizing urban infrastructure and making optimal use of urban resources, cities can be created that significantly improve the quality of life for citizens.</h4>\nsrc=\"/media/output_11.png\"Smart City Startup\n<h3>And finally</h3>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>As a <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%da%a9%d9%88%d9%86%d9%87-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%be-%d8%ac%d8%b0%d8%a8-%da%a9%d9%86/\" rel=\"noopener\">startup</a> in the field of building <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%be-%d8%b4%d9%87%d8%b1-%d9%87%d9%88%d8%b4%d9%85%d9%86%d8%af-smart-city-startup/\" rel=\"noopener\">smart cities</a>, we are proud to announce that we are currently designing and building the smart city \"Al-Naimah\" in Saudi Arabia. This smart city is designed and built using modern technologies and countless innovations, with the goal of creating a smart, sustainable city with a high quality of life for citizens and optimized energy and resource consumption.</h4>\n<h4>Given that we are seeking the partnership of investors and financial sponsors to complete this major project, we invite you to help us financially support this project based on the goals and capabilities of this startup. By collaborating with us, you can play an important role in the process of realizing a sustainable smart city with a high quality of life.</h4>\n<h4>Thank you for your attention to this invitation. We express our readiness to consider any proposals and cooperate with you.</h4>\n<p>With respect,<br />\nSmart City Project Team</p></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg>Ready to turn this into a product?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">In one AI MVP Sprint I take your idea from first sketch to a live product — in weeks, not months.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:from-violet-700 hover:to-fuchsia-700\" href=\"/mvp-sprint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5